 '008':{question:'WHEN DOES A DASHBOARD BECOME A DECISION PATH?',a:'Name the decision, justify every metric, and make the owner, authority, action, timing, escalation and next observable state explicit.',b:'Move a chart wall through signal, decision-ready and conflict states and see where accountable human control enters.'},
