 '010':{question:'WHAT ARE THE THINGS, RULES, AND RELATIONSHIPS INSIDE THIS IDEA?',a:'Turn loose language into stable entities, typed fields, relationship constraints, and explicit source rules—then validate the skeleton.',b:'Move the same idea from unresolved nouns to named entities and a validated, explorable graph.'},
