 '014':{question:'WHO OWNS EACH LAYER OF LEGAL JUDGMENT?',a:'Separate authority research, synthesis, interpretation, inference, strategy, approval, professional judgment, and client authority with explicit supervision.',b:'Decompose one legal answer into distinct AI-assist, supervised, lawyer-owned, and client-owned layers.'},
