 '016':{question:'WHAT ACTUALLY HAS TO MOVE—AND WHO ACCEPTS RESPONSIBILITY AT EVERY TRANSFER?',a:'Map actors, documents, authorities, deadlines, decisions, risks, records, and nine-field handoffs; then break an acceptance control and inspect the gap.',b:'Open a linear legal request into the actors, evidence, controls, and records that actually make the matter move.'},
